# Tests. Written both bare and **/-prefixed: Docker matches .dockerignore patterns root-relative, so a
# bare pattern misses nested copies. This agent's tests sit beside main.py inside codeLocation, so
# without these they would ship in the image.
test_*.py
**/test_*.py
